== DESIGN 5.6: rule to fixtures
  rule 1 project and root: 1 of 1 pinned: (lsp_workspace: ProjectModel.key and a program without a manifest)
  rule 2 closure through imports: 1 of 1 pinned: files-are-found-only-through-imports
  rule 3 packages and qualifiers: 2 of 2 pinned: qualifier-is-the-last-segment,package-main-folder-is-root-level
  rule 4 the package line: 1 of 1 pinned: package-line-must-match-the-folder
  rule 5 std modules: 2 of 2 pinned: local-folder-shadows-std,std-module-not-imported
  rule 6 dependency imports: 1 of 1 pinned: dependency-root-level-is-unqualified
  rule 7 names: 10 of 10 pinned: own-package-wins,root-wins-over-package-function,unique-package-function,ambiguous-package-function,ambiguous-package-global,class-method-wins-over-package-function,class-beats-root-function,core-builtin-beats-user-function,duplicate-class-definition,variables-in-loader-order
  rule 8 overloads: 1 of 1 pinned: overloads-by-name-and-arity
  rule 9 flat visibility: 1 of 1 pinned: visibility-is-flat
  rule 10 main package wins: 1 of 1 pinned: root-wins-over-package-function
